lated tile that doesn't connect with any other tiles in my hand. With only 3 copies unshown, it has limited potential for forming pairs or pungs. Meanwhile, my bamboo tiles (T2-T6) form a strong consecutive sequence, and my dots tiles (B6, B7, B8\u00d73) can form both chows and a pung. Discarding W5 maintains maximum flexibility for developing winning patterns while removing a dead tile.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
